<#f0f000>COMMAND NORMALS</>
Overhead            						_F_+^B
   <#bbbbbb>An overhead kick with two hits. Chain OK.</>
Uppercut            						_F_+^C
   <#bbbbbb>A powerful uppercut. AIR RAID OK. Hits OTG</>

<#f0f000>THROWS</>
Hands Off   								[_B/_F]_+^A +^B

<#f0f000>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Fatal Introduction_EX						_QDF^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A projectile attack.
   A Version is slow.
   B Version is fast.
   C Version is fastest and 3 hits.</>
Territory Lord_EX							_DSF^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>An anti-air attack with a large hitbox and reversal potential.
   A version is fast upper body invul. [R]
   B version is full invul. [R] (Midcombo)
   EX is fast, full invul, and good for juggles. [R] (Midcombo)</>
Water's Edge_EX_AIROK								_QDB^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A series of kick attacks.
   A version is a upward kick that starts combos. Has followups.
   B Version lunges across the screen at high speed. [R]
   EX is an overhead that knocks down air opponents. [R]</>
_!Extra kick								(After A Version) ^A
  _!Knockdown [R]								    (After A Version) ^A

